  m_name: Canine Back Mount
  m_description: The Death Hound can start to become ferocious, and it will start
    to hunt down its prey. When it's close enough, it will leap towards its victim.
    If the victim is facing away from the attack, the canine will instantly start
    raping her. The victim should be wary, and not turn her back towards the charging
    canine.
